  "content": "<p><strong>Cumulative frequency:</strong> Running total of frequencies. Plot at upper class boundaries. Read off median (½n), Q1 (¼n), Q3 (¾n).</p><p><strong>Box plot:</strong> Shows min, Q1, median, Q3, max. IQR = Q3 − Q1.</p><p><strong>Histogram:</strong> Frequency density = frequency ÷ class width. Area of bar = frequency.</p>",
  "example": "<p><strong>Class 10-20, frequency 15, class width 10.</strong></p><p>Frequency density = 15/10 = 1.5.</p>"
